Squinch logo pack
=================

Icon artwork in `icons/` comes from Simple Icons (https://simpleicons.org),
released under CC0-1.0 (public domain dedication). The Simple Icons project
requires no attribution; this notice records provenance anyway.

The *brands* the icons depict are trademarks of their respective owners.
Inclusion here is nominative use — identifying a product in an architecture
diagram — and implies no endorsement or affiliation. Trademark law, not the
icon licence, governs how these marks may be used; consult the owner's brand
guidelines before using a logo in anything published or commercial.

Icons are copied verbatim from the upstream package and regenerated with
`npm run fetch`. Squinch renders them monochrome on a brand-coloured plate;
that treatment is applied at render time and never modifies the source file.
